FPC Membership Class
\f1\b0\fs26 \cb1 \

\f3\fs32 \cb3 This 4-week series is a vehicle for learning more about the Christian faith and First Presbyterian Church.\'a0
\f1\fs26 \cf2  
\f3\fs32 \cf2  Membership not only entails "who" we are, but also entails "what" we believe and \'93how\'94 we are to serve.\'a0
\f1\fs26 \cf2 \'a0
\f3\fs32 \cf2 We will discuss the larger denomination the church is a part of, specific theological foundations, as well as what it means to be a part of the Body of Christ at First Presbyterian Church..\'a0 
\f1\fs26 \cb1 \

